Point BaseStrategy at the Hedera TokenizedStrategy deployment.

Yearn has no canonical TokenizedStrategy deployment on Hedera. The singleton was
deployed from unmodified upstream source at the commit pinned by this repository's
lib/tokenized-strategy submodule (8c8929f1878e8c5ad78aa0a6dabc877a890f68d9,
API_VERSION 3.1.0):

    0xccC8Ee9a1A559Fa814a886A2303F03239678eC8e   (Hedera 0.0.10757286)

BaseStrategy hardcodes that address as a constant, so it must be repointed.
This is the ONLY modification to upstream Yearn code and it changes no logic.

Apply from the repository root:

    git apply -p1 --directory=lib/tokenized-strategy \
      patches/0001-hedera-tokenizedstrategy-address.patch

diff --git a/src/BaseStrategy.sol b/src/BaseStrategy.sol
index 8a7c09b..b93db03 100644
--- a/src/BaseStrategy.sol
+++ b/src/BaseStrategy.sol
@@ -109,7 +109,7 @@ abstract contract BaseStrategy {
      * and always be checked before any integration with the Strategy.
      */
     address public constant tokenizedStrategyAddress =
-        0x310f5Db015E9d6E542fd41bd4542640790791e76;
+        0xccC8Ee9a1A559Fa814a886A2303F03239678eC8e;
 
     /*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
                             IMMUTABLES
